As a VAS Employee at DHL, you'll be responsible for performing various value-added services such as labeling, repacking, assembling promotional packages, and quality control. Your work ensures that every product leaving our warehouse meets customer-specific requirements — adding that extra touch of value that sets DHL apart.

- You are fulltime available;
